<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-011" chapter-id="c-nanshi-011-panshufei" source-id="s-nanshi-011-panshufei-ws2288359">
  <p id="c-nanshi-011-panshufei:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-011-panshufei:p001:m0000" ref="8ge_4zd_66p">潘</persName>淑妃者，本以貌進，始未見賞。帝好乘羊車經諸房，淑妃每莊飾褰帷以候，並密令左右以鹹水灑地。帝每至戶，羊輒舐地不去。帝曰：「羊乃為汝徘徊，況於人乎。」于此愛傾後宮。</p>
</text>
